<!-- Substitution Policy Section -->
<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16" style="animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards;">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Store Policies</span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Substitution Policy</h1>
      <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-primary mx-auto rounded-full opacity-50"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-2xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/50 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed space-y-8" style="animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards; animation-delay: 0.2s;">
      
      <div class="prose max-w-none">
        <p class="text-lg">At Floral India, we strive to deliver exactly what you see on our website. However, due to the seasonal and regional availability of flowers, plants, and other gifts, it is sometimes necessary to make substitutions of equal or greater value.</p>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-6 h-0.5 bg-primary rounded"></span> Flower Substitutions</h3>
        <p>In arrangements of assorted flowers, the colors shown online will be used if at all possible, even if this means substituting other kinds of flowers of equal or greater value.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-4 space-y-2">
          <li>For one-of-a-kind flower arrangements, such as all roses or all lilies, we will make every attempt to match the flower type, but may substitute with another color.</li>
          <li>If the floral container shown online is not available, a similar container will be used.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-6 h-0.5 bg-primary rounded"></span> Specialty Gifts</h3>
        <p>Specialty gifts may be substituted with another specialty gift of equal or greater value and of similar theme and category. This applies to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Chocolates and Sweets</li>
          <li>Teddy Bears and Soft Toys</li>
          <li>Fruit Hampers</li>
          <li>Balloons and Decor</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-6 h-0.5 bg-primary rounded"></span> Cakes</h3>
        <p>Cake flavors and designs are subject to local bakery availability. If the specific flavor or design is unavailable, we will substitute it with a similar, high-quality alternative of equal or greater value to ensure your celebration is not interrupted.</p>

        <div class="mt-10 p-6 bg-primary/5 rounded-xl border border-primary/10">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary m-0">Please Note: We will never substitute a main element without ensuring the overall aesthetic, feel, and value of the arrangement remains exceptional. Your satisfaction is our priority.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes fadeInUp { from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)} to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)} }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Substitution Policy",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
